  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## HL · Order dispatched WhatsApp update (Lesson 5.1)\nWhen an order is dispatched: opted in? -> inside the 24-hour window? free-form message : approved utility template order_ready.\n\nTemplate (create in WhatsApp Manager, category Utility, wait for approval):\nHello (1), your Harvest Lane order (2) is on its way and should arrive (3). Reply here if you have any questions.\n(WhatsApp Manager writes the variables as 1, 2, 3 in double curly braces.)\n\nCredentials: WhatsApp API on Free-form update and on Send Template order_ready (HTTP Request, Predefined credential type WhatsApp API), Google Sheets on Window log.\nPlaceholders: YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID, YOUR_SHEET_ID (tab Window log: order_id, phone, path, template_name, category, sent_at).\n\nIn your real order workflow, replace the manual trigger and test data with the dispatch event.",
    "height": 460,
    "width": 500
   },
